import{_ as o,C as l,o as n,c as i,j as t,a as d,E as c,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CdvW4CUT.js";const b=JSON.parse('{"title":"SDF Glyph Atlas & Text Layout Renderer (dev.anvilcraft.lib.v2.font.sdf)","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/26.2/font/sdf-renderer.md","filePath":"en/26.2/font/sdf-renderer.md"}'),s={name:"en/26.2/font/sdf-renderer.md"};function u(p,e,h,f,g,y){const a=l("BranchContextCard");return n(),i("div",null,[e[0]||(e[0]=t("h1",{id:"sdf-glyph-atlas-text-layout-renderer-dev-anvilcraft-lib-v2-font-sdf",tabindex:"-1"},[d("SDF Glyph Atlas & Text Layout Renderer ("),t("code",null,"dev.anvilcraft.lib.v2.font.sdf"),d(") "),t("a",{class:"header-anchor",href:"#sdf-glyph-atlas-text-layout-renderer-dev-anvilcraft-lib-v2-font-sdf","aria-label":'Permalink to "SDF Glyph Atlas & Text Layout Renderer (`dev.anvilcraft.lib.v2.font.sdf`)"'},"​")],-1)),c(a,{branch:"26.2"}),e[1]||(e[1]=r('<p>This page dives into <code>module.font</code>&#39;s low-level SDF (Signed Distance Field) glyph generation algorithm, dynamic paged atlas management, text layout caching, and 26.2 GUI render-state submission pipeline.</p><hr><h2 id="_1-how-the-sdf-text-rendering-pipeline-works" tabindex="-1">1. How the SDF Text Rendering Pipeline Works <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-how-the-sdf-text-rendering-pipeline-works" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1. How the SDF Text Rendering Pipeline Works&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Virtual-Thread Async Glyph Rasterization &amp; EDT Distance Field (<code>SdfGlyphAtlas</code>)</strong>: <ul><li>Each <code>java.awt.Font</code> (uniquely keyed by <code>fontName.style.size</code>, automatically derived to <code>64px</code> HD if size <code>&lt; 4</code>) maps to one <code>SdfGlyphAtlas</code> instance;</li><li>On initialization, ASCII <code>32–126</code> characters are generated synchronously; when non-ASCII codepoints (Chinese, Japanese, symbols) are encountered, <code>atlas.glyph(codepoint, ...)</code> immediately returns <code>null</code> (advancing by half-width whitespace for that frame without blocking the render thread) and dispatches the codepoint to <code>AnvilLib-SDF-Glyph-*</code> virtual threads;</li><li>On the background thread, AWT <code>Graphics2D</code> renders the glyph into an anti-aliased alpha mask on a white background, then a two-pass <strong>Dead Reckoning Euclidean Distance Transform (EDT)</strong> computes the signed distance to the nearest edge, normalized to <code>[0, 255]</code> in <code>SdfGlyphPage</code> (<code>0.5</code> / <code>128</code> is the glyph contour), with <code>padding</code> border extrusion around each cell to prevent bilinear sampling bleed.</li><li>Once generated, <code>SdfGlyphPage.version</code> increments and <code>SdfTextLayout.invalidateAtlas(key)</code> invalidates layout caches so the new glyph appears on the next frame.</li></ul></li><li><strong>On-Demand Dirty Page Upload to Single-Channel GPU Texture (<code>SdfAtlasTexture</code> &amp; <code>SdfGlyphPage</code>)</strong>: <ul><li>Each <code>SdfGlyphPage</code> is <code>1024 × 1024</code>. Before each frame, <code>SdfAtlasTexture.ensureUploaded(atlas)</code> checks every page&#39;s <code>dirty</code> flag and atomic <code>version</code>; if updated, it uploads to a <code>TextureFormat.RED8</code> single-channel GPU texture with a <code>FilterMode.LINEAR</code> sampler.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Page-Bucketed CPU Layout Cache (<code>SdfTextLayout</code>)</strong>: <ul><li><code>SdfTextLayout.fromAtlas(atlas, text, x, y, scale)</code> converts codepoints into <code>GlyphQuad</code> rectangles relative to <code>(0, 0)</code> and buckets them by <code>pageIndex</code> into <code>List&lt;PageQuads&gt;</code>;</li><li>When all codepoints in a text are ready (<code>allGlyphsAvailable == true</code>), the layout is cached in <code>LAYOUT_CACHE</code> (capacity <code>1024</code>) keyed by <code>(atlasKey, text, round(scale * 1000))</code>.</li></ul></li><li><strong>GUI Render State Submission (<code>SdfTextRenderer</code> &amp; <code>SdfTextRenderState</code>)</strong>: <ul><li><code>SdfTextRenderer</code> parses colors, bold/italic (<code>base.deriveFont(mask)</code>), underline/strikethrough, and obfuscation (randomizing ASCII every <code>300 ms</code>) from <code>FormattedCharSequence</code>, wraps each <code>PageQuads</code> into <code>SdfTextRenderState</code> (implementing <code>LibGuiElementRenderState</code>), and submits it via <code>graphics.submitGuiElementRenderState(state)</code> to Minecraft 26.2&#39;s GUI pipeline.</li></ul></li></ol><hr><h2 id="_2-classes-api-reference" tabindex="-1">2. Classes &amp; API Reference <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-classes-api-reference" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2. Classes &amp; API Reference&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-sdftextrenderer-sdf-text-renderer-beta" tabindex="-1">1. <code>SdfTextRenderer</code> (SDF Text Renderer, <code>@Beta</code>) <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-sdftextrenderer-sdf-text-renderer-beta" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1. `SdfTextRenderer` (SDF Text Renderer, `@Beta`)&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Located in <code>dev.anvilcraft.lib.v2.font.sdf.SdfTextRenderer</code>. Usually obtained via <code>GuiGraphicsExtractor#anvillib$textRenderer()</code>, or instantiated directly.</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Constructor / Method Signature</th><th style="text-align:left;">Parameters &amp; Behavior</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public SdfTextRenderer()</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Creates a renderer bound to a <code>FilterMode.LINEAR</code> edge-clamped sampler.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void drawString(GuiGraphicsExtractor graphics, @Nullable Font font, @Nullable String text, int x, int y, int color, boolean dropShadow)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Draws a plain string at <code>(x, y)</code> using <code>font</code> (falls back to <code>Dialog</code> 64px if <code>null</code>). Returns immediately if <code>text</code> is <code>null</code> or empty.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void drawComponent(GuiGraphicsExtractor graphics, @Nullable Font font, Component text, int x, int y, int color, boolean dropShadow)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Converts <code>Component</code> to <code>text.getVisualOrderText()</code> and delegates to <code>drawFormatted</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void drawFormatted(GuiGraphicsExtractor graphics, @Nullable Font font, FormattedCharSequence text, int x, int y, int color, boolean dropShadow)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Iterates characters in <code>FormattedCharSequence</code>:<br>• Supports <code>style.isObfuscated()</code> dynamic random character scrambling;<br>• Flushes segments (<code>flushFormattedSegment</code>) and derives weighted <code>Font</code>s whenever color, <code>bold</code>, or <code>italic</code> changes;<br>• Supports <code>style.isUnderlined()</code> and <code>style.isStrikethrough()</code> using <code>0.5f</code> Y-axis scaling for crisp thin lines.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void drawWrapped(GuiGraphicsExtractor graphics, @Nullable Font font, FormattedText text, int x, int y, int width, int color, boolean dropShadow)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Wraps <code>text</code> to <code>width</code> using <code>ALFont.wrapLines</code> and draws line by line with <code>lineHeight</code> spacing.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void drawCentered(GuiGraphicsExtractor graphics, @Nullable Font font, Component text, int x, int y, int color)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Measures visual width of <code>Component</code> and draws centered around <code>x</code> via <code>drawFormatted</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void drawCentered(GuiGraphicsExtractor graphics, @Nullable Font font, FormattedCharSequence text, int x, int y, int color)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Measures width of <code>FormattedCharSequence</code> and draws centered around <code>x</code> via <code>drawFormatted</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_2-sdfglyphatlas-multi-page-on-demand-sdf-glyph-atlas-apistatus-internal" tabindex="-1">2. <code>SdfGlyphAtlas</code> (Multi-Page On-Demand SDF Glyph Atlas, <code>@ApiStatus.Internal</code>) <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-sdfglyphatlas-multi-page-on-demand-sdf-glyph-atlas-apistatus-internal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2. `SdfGlyphAtlas` (Multi-Page On-Demand SDF Glyph Atlas, `@ApiStatus.Internal`)&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Located in <code>dev.anvilcraft.lib.v2.font.sdf.SdfGlyphAtlas</code>.</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Method / Record Signature</th><th style="text-align:left;">Return Type</th><th style="text-align:left;">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public static CompletableFuture&lt;SdfGlyphAtlas&gt; getOrCreate(@Nullable Font font)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>CompletableFuture&lt;SdfGlyphAtlas&gt;</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Asynchronously builds (or retrieves from cache) the SDF atlas <code>CompletableFuture</code> for <code>font</code> on background virtual threads.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public static @Nullable SdfGlyphAtlas getIfReady(@Nullable Font font)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>@Nullable SdfGlyphAtlas</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Non-blocking atlas lookup: returns the instance if ready, <code>null</code> if still building, or removes a failed future and re-triggers building if a previous attempt failed.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public String key()</code> / <code>public Font font()</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>String</code> / <code>Font</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Returns the unique atlas key (<code>&lt;fontName&gt;.&lt;style&gt;.&lt;size&gt;</code>) and resolved <code>64px</code> <code>Font</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public int awtHeight()</code> / <code>public int awtAscent()</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>int</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Returns total height and baseline ascent of the AWT font at atlas size.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public int pageCount()</code> / <code>public SdfGlyphPage page(int index)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>int</code> / <code>SdfGlyphPage</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Returns the number of allocated <code>1024×1024</code> atlas pages and the page at <code>index</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public @Nullable GlyphEntry glyph(int codepoint, Consumer&lt;SdfGlyphPage&gt; pageConsumer)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>@Nullable GlyphEntry</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Queries the glyph entry for a Unicode codepoint. If not yet generated, submits an async virtual-thread task and returns <code>null</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public int measureText(String text)</code> / <code>measureText(String text, int start, int end)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>int</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Measures total advance width of a string or substring in atlas pixel coordinates (unready glyphs count as <code>cellSize / 2</code>).</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public int measureCodepoint(int codepoint)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>int</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Measures the advance width of a single codepoint in atlas pixel coordinates.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public record GlyphEntry(int pageIndex, int atlasX, int atlasY, int width, int height, int advance)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>record</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Stores a glyph&#39;s page index, top-left coordinates <code>(atlasX, atlasY)</code>, dimensions (with <code>endX()</code> / <code>endY()</code> helpers), and horizontal <code>advance</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="_3-sdfglyphpage-sdfatlastexture-sdftextlayout-sdftextrenderstate-apistatus-internal" tabindex="-1">3. <code>SdfGlyphPage</code>, <code>SdfAtlasTexture</code>, <code>SdfTextLayout</code> &amp; <code>SdfTextRenderState</code> (<code>@ApiStatus.Internal</code>) <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-sdfglyphpage-sdfatlastexture-sdftextlayout-sdftextrenderstate-apistatus-internal" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3. `SdfGlyphPage`, `SdfAtlasTexture`, `SdfTextLayout` &amp; `SdfTextRenderState` (`@ApiStatus.Internal`)&quot;">​</a></h3><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Class</th><th style="text-align:left;">Core Method Signatures</th><th style="text-align:left;">Responsibilities</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>SdfGlyphPage</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public void updateHash()</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Manages a single <code>1024×1024</code> <code>TYPE_BYTE_GRAY</code> grayscale buffered image, grid row/column cursors, and <code>AtomicInteger version</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>SdfAtlasTexture</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public static Identifier uploadPage(SdfGlyphAtlas atlas, int pageIndex)</code><br><code>public static void ensureUploaded(SdfGlyphAtlas atlas)</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Converts dirty pages to <code>NativeImage</code> and uploads them as <code>TextureFormat.RED8</code> + <code>FilterMode.LINEAR</code> GPU textures registered with <code>Minecraft.getInstance().getTextureManager()</code> (path like <code>anvillib_font:dynamic/sdf_atlas/&lt;sanitized_key&gt;</code>).</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>SdfTextLayout</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public static SdfTextLayout fromAtlas(SdfGlyphAtlas atlas, @Nullable String text, int x, int y, float scale)</code><br><code>public static void invalidateAtlas(String atlasKey)</code><br><code>public static void clearCache()</code><br><code>public List&lt;PageQuads&gt; pages()</code><br><code>public int width()</code> / <code>public int height()</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Computes and caches glyph quads for strings. Exposes <code>PageQuads(int pageIndex, @Nullable Identifier atlasTexture, int pageWidth, int pageHeight, List&lt;GlyphQuad&gt; quads)</code> and <code>GlyphQuad(int x0, int y0, int x1, int y1, float u0, float v0, float u1, float v1, char glyph)</code>.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><code>SdfTextRenderState</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>public record SdfTextRenderState(...) implements LibGuiElementRenderState</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Implements <code>module.rendering</code>&#39;s <code>LibGuiElementRenderState</code>, binding <code>ALFPipelines.SDF_TEXT</code> and <code>DiffuseSampler</code>, submitting glyph quad vertices via <code>consumer.addVertexWith2DPose</code> in <code>buildVertices</code>, and computing scissor bounds via <code>LibGuiElementRenderState.getBounds</code>.</td></tr></tbody></table>',14))])}const m=o(s,[["render",u]]);export{b as __pageData,m as default};
